that this feed hijacking had
extortion written all over it.

40:32.000 --> 40:38.000
In getting his URL for my
podcast, carried by Yahoo's
directory,

40:38.000 --> 40:46.000
the owner of podkeyword.com was
establishing himself as the
gatekeeper who could control all
traffic to my show

40:46.000 --> 40:49.000
from listeners who were
subscribed through Yahoo.

